## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Reference memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` plus the **Library Card** typed-edge axes (when the subject is a library or non-trivial external concept):

- **Documentation** — `documents` / `documented-by` (reference ↔ library)
- **Mereology** — `has-part` / `part-of` (umbrella ↔ topic)
- **Formal realization** — `implements` / `implemented-by` (realizes a spec / paper / RFC)
- **Lineage** — `descends-from` / `ancestor-of` (genetic relationship in design history)
- **Dependencies** — `consumes` / `consumed-by` (library uses another library)
- **Provenance** — `created-by` (author / maker)
- **Research substrate** — `cites` (papers / talks / docs grounding the design)
- **Methodology attribution** — `provides-method-for` / `uses-method-in`
- **Domain tagging** — `domain-tags` (free-form string field for project-scoped retrieval)
- **Design-space positioning** — `disagrees-with` / `is-disagreed-with-by`
- **Empirical grounding** — `evidences` / `evidenced-by`

Each axis is OPTIONAL; populate where applicable.

